@sunshaobei/dsh-session-manager README · Local development install：```bash
dsh plugin --profile web add link:/absolute/path/to/harness-session-delete
```

@sunshaobei/dsh-session-manager README · 🔌 How it works：- A **single npm bundle** covers both halves, same as other published plugins: the host row mounts via `cordis.patch.yml`; the browser half joins automatically through `dsh.client` + `exports["./client"]`.
- The browser talks to the host over the plugin's own `/api/session-trash/*` HTTP routes (registered on the webserver; non-GET requests carry an `x-dsh-plugin` CSRF header).

